  <h3>Emergency Fund Growth</h3>
  <p>Even conservative savings benefit from compounding. A cash ISA at 4% AER with £10,000 grows to £14,802 over 10 years without any additional deposits. While this pales compared to stock market returns, it demonstrates that compounding works in any interest-bearing account. The key is simply leaving the money alone and letting time do the work.</p>

